@startuml
title Sequence Diagram for Member 2: Image Storage (Factory Pattern)
autonumber

actor Admin
participant "AdminController" as AC
participant "Factory:StorageFactory" as SF
participant "Adapter:ImageStorageService" as ISS
participant "CloudinaryAdapter" as CA
participant "LocalStorageAdapter" as LA
database "Storage/Cloud" as ST

Admin -> AC : Upload ảnh sản phẩm (MultipartFile)
activate AC

AC -> SF : getStorageService()
activate SF
SF -> SF : Read property 'storage.provider'
alt provider == 'cloudinary'
    SF -> CA : Return CloudinaryAdapter
else provider == 'local'
    SF -> LA : Return LocalStorageAdapter
end
SF --> AC : adapter
deactivate SF

AC -> ISS : uploadImage(file)
activate ISS
ISS -> ST : Gửi dữ liệu ảnh & Lưu trữ
ST --> ISS : Trả về URL ảnh
ISS --> AC : imageUrl
deactivate ISS

AC -> AC : Lưu imageUrl vào DB (Product/Topping)
AC --> Admin : Hiển thị sản phẩm với ảnh mới
deactivate AC

@enduml
